sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Host MCP client
    participant RS as MCP Resource Server
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant DS as Device Service
    H->>RS: tools/call control_device with token A
    RS->>RS: validate token A and its DPoP proof, check scope devices:control
    alt token B cached for this grant and scope, over 10 s left
        RS->>RS: use cached token B
    else no usable token B
        RS->>AS: POST /token-exchange over mTLS, subject_token A, audience device.internal, scope devices:control
        Note over AS: caller is the RS workload, subject aud is mcp, scope narrowed, grant live
        AS-->>RS: token B: JWT at+jwt, 60 s, act mcp-rs, cnf x5t S256 of the RS cert
    end
    RS->>DS: PUT state over mTLS, Authorization Bearer token B
    Note over DS: alg ES256, kid in JWKS, iss, aud, exp, scope, act equals peer, cnf equals peer cert
    DS->>DS: ownership from sub, version check, audit
    DS-->>RS: device
    RS-->>H: tool result
    Note over RS,AS: on a revocation event the RS drops every token B for that grant
